    {
      "id": "spec:project:learnings-002",
      "type": "spec",
      "title": "XC330-T288 官方 Goal Current 与 Present Current 单位约为 1 mA/count；orca_core 当前沿用 DEFAULT_CUR_SCALE=1.34 读取 Present Current，却直接把调用值写入 Goal Current，读写标度不一致。任何基于 current threshold 的新控制前都应改为 model-specific conversion，并分别暴露 goal current 与 current limit 语义。",
      "summary": "XC330-T288 官方 Goal Current 与 Present Current 单位约为 1 mA/count；orca_core 当前沿用 DEFAULT_CUR_SCALE=1.34 读取 Present Current，却直接把调用值写入 Goal Current，读写标度不一致。任何基于 current threshold 的新控制前都应改为 model-specific conversion，并分别暴露 goal current 与 current lim",
      "tags": [
        "xc330",
        "current-scale",
        "goal-current",
        "present-current",
        "orca-core"
      ],
      "status": "active",
